{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）上午8時54分，警方接獲一名司機報案，指其Land Rover的JEEP於連翔道（往油麻地方向）近奧海城對開起火。消防及救援人員到場，相信私家車懷疑因過熱冒煙，沒有着火，事件中無人受傷。現場可見，受事故影響上址交通擠塞。</p><p>現場消息指，女司機駕駛私家車行經上址，車頭突然冒煙，於是報警求助。</p><figure><img alt=\"車輛懷疑過熱冒煙。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148561799461867520534821.jpeg/CA8vWs8o7WynsYWVzv5PoNGv-Sot3t3IJRGlDAARpQw\"/><figcaption>車輛懷疑過熱冒煙。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場交通擠塞。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148561805048942592329501.jpeg/gWkAyBTYoU3HxdRiptC8ZITKvVyzGszPvyCH_Jogh_w\"/><figcaption>現場交通擠塞。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護車到場候命。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148561802129575936716239.jpeg/uKAw234hGwNMzqW0I1NUbtG7itMh7pKTNrxblhO8W5Y\"/><figcaption>救護車到場候命。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車懷疑過熱。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148561796479586304432509.jpeg/Tt-3WnsONLubFTTwzZOVVAKnoUFefUSWvQeyoZgHsqE\"/><figcaption>私家車懷疑過熱。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-30T02:40:12.094241+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}